Thank you for the report.  I would consider the input incorrect, since
it makes no sense for a \section command to appear inside an enumerate
environment.  Admittedly, the manual does not explicitly state that
this such input is incorrect.  (I would appreciate any suggestions on
how the manual could indicate this, without listing innumerable such
nonsensical constructions.)  And of course, an error message would be
more helpful than an infinite loop.  I hope that LaTeX3 will provide
such error messages.

Leslie Lamport



